# Built lesson data — not published.
#
# lessons-data.json is generated by OBS_InforR-Lower/tools/build-lessons-data.py
# from the SDARM Sabbath School lesson files in ~/Developer/sbl/data/. It holds the
# full text of the lessons in 22 languages. That text is not ours to redistribute,
# so the repository ships the build script and not its output. Run:
#
#     cd OBS_InforR-Lower && python3 tools/build-lessons-data.py
#
# to regenerate it locally. See README.md and OBS_InforR-Lower/LOCAL-SETUP.md.
OBS_InforR-Lower/lessons-data.json

# Upstream font files fetched by tools/build-cjk-fonts.py -- tens of megabytes,
# and only ever an input to the small subsets that ARE committed.
OBS_InforR-Lower/tools/.font-cache/
